  "content": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_c994dbae-27aa-48c2-a491-2b24d186d63a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"796\" height=\"71\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">&nbsp;！注意！本模組包含較為血腥的畫面，以及提及毒品和死亡的內容，下載前請知悉！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>感謝大家達到 10,000 次下載！！！</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>你在為你的 Fnaf 建築尋找方塊，但卻找不到合適的類型嗎？我來幫你搞定！</em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"></em><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"></em><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">FTFM 為你的世界添加了來自幾乎每一款 Fnaf 遊戲（從 Fnaf 1 到 Security Breach！）（最終版本）以及粉絲作品和原創內容的風格化方塊、裝飾品和物品！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>還是找不到你需要的東西嗎？儘管提出要求添加！我非常樂於接受建議！</em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_1b2dfb37-ca58-40f0-a0ee-03b877197fdb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"193\" height=\"193\"></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/985321/description_a5f2168f-fde4-4d3a-a8ed-7f4dce1379b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\"></em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>專案：Tiles 由我創作！！（雖然其中的內容尚未加入模組。）</em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Mine Nights At Freddy's 由 CavemanFilms 創作</em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Five Nights At Freddy's 由 Scott Cawthon 創作（我不喜歡他。）</em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Minecraft Five Nights At Freddy's 由... xd####thx... 創作（我真的不喜歡他。）</em></p>",
